  "releaseNotes": "Remove Task-based HTTP API; add host header:\n      - Remove the Task-based SendRequest/Send* wrappers and related TaskCompletionSource/Deadline logic from HTTP client protocol and client classes, consolidating on synchronous and async send methods.\n      - Ensure outgoing requests include a Host header by adding request.AddHeader(StorageData.Host, Session.Address) in SendRequest/SendRequestAsync.\n      - Refactor SessionTransport to use a configurable OptionSendChannelCapacity (default 20) when creating the send channel and update channel recreation accordingly; remove several leftover/commented buffer initializations.\n      - Minor cleanup: adjust usings and drop redundant initialization in UdpSession.",
